direction_620 = location "Machirodus" about "Machirodus\nA Smirdon monster representative of Adonis, its body is wrapped in sturdy armor and is noted for speedy attack ability. " found "El Morad" at 1753 1129 in zone 2

On available
    Say "Master, Perhaps you've heard of the personal accessories that hold the Strength of Legends? Cheina might know something..."
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    Say "Hmm. I have 2 Legendary Accessories. I will reward you with the first of 2 rings when you complete the Machirodus hunt."
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "The Machirodus is a kind of  Smirdon. Remember them? He's got hard skin and a quick attack, so don't treat him lightly. Would you like to try?"

